 * Evaluates cell content into values, resolving cell references and
 * detecting cycles as a lazy, memoized walk of each cell's formula AST.
 *
 * Cycle detection: a cell currently being evaluated is "visiting"; reaching
 * a visiting cell again yields a transient `#CYCLE!` value rather than
 * recursing further. That transient value then flows through the ordinary
 * error-propagation rules like any other error, so every cell actually on
 * the cycle ends up caching `#CYCLE!` for itself once its own evaluation
 * (which needed to reach back around to itself) completes.
